ENTRY            22397   20251006   20260826   20260826       2323
SUBENT        22397001   20251006   20260826   20260826       2323
BIB                 11         30
TITLE      Measurement of the neutron total cross section of 99Tc
            in the energy range from 3 to 600 eV
AUTHOR     (F.Gunsing, A.Brusegan, A.Lepretre, C.Mounier,
            C.Raepsaet)
INSTITUTE  (2FR SAC,2ZZZGEL)
REFERENCE  (C,97TRIEST,2,1293,1997)
           ((S,ISINN-6,133,1998)=(S,JINR-E3-98-202,133,1998))
FACILITY   (LINAC,2ZZZGEL) GELINA
INC-SOURCE (PHOTO)
           . Electron beam energy:  100 MeV.
           . averaged current 20 uA (thin sample), 60 uA (thick
             sample)
           . pulse length 15 ns (thin sample), 2 ns (thick sample)
           . repetition rate 200 Hz (thin sample), 800 Hz (thick
             sample)
SAMPLE     99Tc samples with thickness 0.16, 0.44 and 4.0 g/cm2.
           Effective beam time for these thicknesses are 70, 150
            and 450 hours.
DETECTOR   (GLASD) NE912 lithium glass detector for neutron
            detection
METHOD     (TOF) 49.33 m between glass detector and sample
CORRECTION Corrected for detector dead time and background
HISTORY    (19980730C)  + +  Compiled by S.M.    + +
           (20000221A)  + +  Corrected by S.M. - Two Subents
            added and REACTION code Corrected
           (20070108U)  * *  Corrected SM after N.Ohtsuka comment
           (20201012U) SD: Two versions from Trans.2182 and
            Trans. 2157 merged. STATUS updated in all Subents.
            ERR-ANALYS moved to appropriate Subents.
           (20251006A) On. Major revisions in 002+004. 005 added.
ENDBIB              30
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           33
SUBENT        22397002   20251006   20260826   20260826       2323
BIB                  6         15
REACTION  1(43-TC-99(N,0),,EN)
          2(43-TC-99(N,G),,WID)
          3(43-TC-99(N,EL),,WID,,G)
          4(43-TC-99(N,G),,WID/STR)
ASSUMED    (ASSUM,43-TC-99(N,G),,WID)
ANALYSIS   (SHAPE) Program REFIT, L=0 assumed.
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical error
STATUS     (TABLE,,F.Gunsing,C,97TRIEST,,1293,1997) Table 1
           (SPSDD,22486003) final publication
HISTORY    (20000221A) Reaction code corrected
           (20070108U) SF2, SF3 fields (N,0) in REACTION pointer
            4 changed to (N,G)
           (20201012A) SD: STATUS updated. ERR-ANALYS added.
            SF9=DERIV deleted from REACTION code (4).
           (20251006A) On. Usage of ASSUM changed. L=0 added.
ENDBIB              15
COMMON               1          3
MOMENTUM L
NO-DIM
 0.
ENDCOMMON            3
